1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,979
A storm is violent.

2
00:00:01,979 --> 00:00:03,958
Soft is gentle.

3
00:00:03,958 --> 00:00:09,401
Put them together, soft storm, and you get a contradiction, an oxymoron.

4
00:00:09,401 --> 00:00:15,286
That contradiction, in the title and repeated through the poem, is the whole argument.

